            <p style="margin:0; color:#059669; font-size:28px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:-0.5px;">₦{{formattedAmount}}</p>
            <p style="margin:8px 0 0; color:#059669; font-size:14px;">✅ Ready to use</p>
